# Root-level markdown — personal notes, scratch work.
# Design docs belong in design/. The negations below are the tracked exceptions.
/*.md
!/CLAUDE.md
# Mirrored universal rules, imported by CLAUDE.md. Must be tracked — a trailing
# comment here would NOT be a comment (.gitignore only honours # at line start)
# and would silently make this negation match nothing.
!/CLAUDE-universal.md

# Personal notes and drafts (CLAUDE-universal.md §8).
/docs/
# Local scratch output (e.g. reftest sweeps).
/scratch/

